### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request" above a block.
### Run requests 1 and 2 first (the second one saves the login token for the others).
### Interactive docs are also available at http://localhost:3000/api/docs

@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Register (skip if you ran `npm run db:seed`; seeded users have password "password123")
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Alice", "phone": "0550000001", "password": "password123" }

### 2. Log in (stores the token)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "0550000001", "password": "password123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Report a lost item
POST {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemName": "Black wallet",
  "type": "LOST",
  "place": "Algiers Central Station",
  "date": "2026-10-10",
  "description": "Leather, has ID cards",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/wallet.jpg"
}

### 4. Report a found item
POST {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemName": "Blue umbrella", "type": "FOUND", "place": "Bab Ezzouar", "date": "2026-10-12" }

### 5. Upload a photo with a report (replace the file path)
POST {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----laf

------laf
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="itemName"

House keys
------laf
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

FOUND
------laf
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="place"

Oran
------laf
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="date"

2026-10-15
------laf
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="keys.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./keys.jpg
------laf--

### 6. List all items
GET {{base}}/items

### 7. Search and filter
GET {{base}}/items?type=LOST&q=wallet&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&page=1&limit=10

### 8. Item details
GET {{base}}/items/1

### 9. Update own report (only the fields you send are changed)
PATCH {{base}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "place": "Hydra" }

### 10. Mark as recovered
PATCH {{base}}/items/1/recover
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. My profile with my reports
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
